Bot Workbench
================

This project shows a small team of bots as pixel characters in an office.
The characters, floors, walls, furniture, and pets under public/assets/ are
an unmodified copy of the default asset pack from:

  Pixel Agents
  https://github.com/pixel-agents-hq/pixel-agents
  Commit d1e007a9fdf3003c252d2973abe1999ae59aec33
  Copyright (c) 2026 Pablo De Lucca
  Licensed under the MIT License. See LICENSE.

The sprite sheet layout (7 frames x 16px, 3 direction rows x 32px),
the wall bitmask (N=1, E=2, S=4, W=8), the 6px sitting offset, and the
Photoshop-style floor colorize follow that project. Bot Workbench does not
ship the VS Code extension. It draws the default PNGs on a standalone page.

Bot Workbench's own application code is released under the same MIT License.
The copyright notice above must stay with any copy of the Pixel Agents assets.

The office arrangement (where each desk sits) is Bot Workbench's. The pictures are not.
